      "rationale": "The R26 replacement c=a_k^N+b_k preserves the principal open only on Spec(Cbar), but the proof requires the ambient localization equality (Ibar_k)_c=(Ibar)_c. Replacing by a_k c makes both a_k and c invertible, so c/a_k^N is an annihilating unit; modulo Ibar the new element is a_k^(N+1), preserving the same cover.",
